    "turn_text": "You know, Lonnie, I got to tell you, it's been surprising in a lot of ways, some disappointing ways, but more remarkable ways and inspiring and hopeful ways. And I'll tell you that the biggest epiphany so far is how collegial members are in Congress on both sides of the aisle. If one is just watching MSNBC or Fox News or looking at Twitterdom, you would think it is a unmitigated social disaster in congress and the truth is there are thoughtful members of both parties working together in bipartisan fashions and building friendships and relationships and you gotta be intentional about it i'm one of them who is and it's been great blessing so far",
