    "turn_text": "And I noticed that one of the things during your campaign at least was sort of the old-fashioned retail politics. You had the milk truck, you drove around, and you met people. You did the old school, going to diners, going wherever the people were. Is that something that you think has paid off in terms of the, you know, trying to get along with people from the other side of the island hearing their views on issues?",
