    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "Well, so ethics was a committee that I was asked to join by Speaker Pelosi, and I'm honored to serve on it. It's interesting because it's one of the few committees in which there are an equal number of Democrats and Republicans, five of each. And it's also a closed committee, meaning that we have no staff or the public because of what we deal with,",
